const definitionBody: TextBlockBody[] = [
  'This is the detail cleaning of the things above eye level: venetian and vertical blinds, roller blinds, plantation shutters, pelmets, window tracks and ceiling fan blades. Every one of them collects dust on a horizontal surface you cannot see from standing height, which is why they are invisible until low sun comes through the window and shows you all of it at once. TLB Cleaning cleans blinds, shutters and fans across the Northern Rivers and the Tweed.',
  'It is almost always an add-on rather than a job on its own. A regular clean is scheduled around the surfaces that get used daily, so anything overhead gets done occasionally at best. Booking it once or twice a year alongside a regular visit is how most people deal with it, and it costs less than calling someone out for it separately.',
];

